%% The "less ideal" diagram: five participants, one smeared flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CO as Checkout
    participant CA as Cart
    participant IN as Inventory
    participant PA as Payments
    participant NO as Notifications
    CO->>CA: read basket
    CA->>IN: reserve stock
    IN->>PA: authorise payment
    PA->>NO: emit receipt event
    NO->>CO: confirm dispatch